{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This expansion adds a new character\u2014Mimic Midas, that expands the player's chest capacity to infinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Changes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The player's chest now has an infinite number of pages, so you can put as many items as you want in it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can meet Mimic Midas in the Altar of Hope and talk to him. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you stand next to Mimic Midas in the Altar of Hope, you have access to the player's chest. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The chest in the cemetery is replaced with Mimic Midas, who pretends to be a simple chest.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3567250?t=1742333878","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3567250?t=1742333878","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567250/a801a1fd787eb46efefe896ecfff40d3afa20ced/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742333878","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567250/a801a1fd787eb46efefe896ecfff40d3afa20ced/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742333878","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This expansion adds a new character\u2014Mimic Midas, that expands the player's chest capacity to infinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Changes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><